Package: taskly
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Taskly Team
Depends: libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, ca-certificates
Description: Cross-platform task manager for humans and AI agents
 Taskly provides a clean GUI (inspired by macOS Reminders) plus a CLI
 interface designed for AI agents. Built with Avalonia and .NET.
